                  <photoshop:LayerText>1</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Geography of customers covers almost all countries of the world</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Geography of customers covers almost all countries of the world. Considering legal structure and licence of the company, citizens of the USA can register on the site, but cannot use the company's services. Citizens of Russia are the most interested by company's services as of November, 2017.   Site visits according to Yandex.Metrica data                 Customer of the company â€” man, from 45Â to 54 years old,Â with own capital for investments or trading.    The age of official site visitors - according to Yandex.Metrica data </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
